  "short_description": "《恐怖蜥蜴》是一款恐怖跑酷遊戲，背景設定在一個古老的66號公路景點……其地下潛藏著黑暗邪惡的事物。為了逃出生天，你必須快速移動、跨越險惡地形，並揭開「道爾頓恐龍樂園」究竟隱藏著什麼秘密。你最好快點跑起來。",
  "short_description_en": "Terrible Lizards is a horror parkour game set against the backdrop of an old Route 66 attraction… with something dark and sinister lurking below. To escape, you’ll need to move fast, navigate challenging terrain, and uncover what Dalton’s Dinos is really hiding. You’d better start running.",
